        "slc_df48e73ad9357e0603a86a6827e0fa7f93bf2cb782a8f632ab60d94cfb501fe0"
      ],
      "text": "hax is described as a minimalist, terminal-native coding agent implemented as a single native C binary with a small dependency set and low memory use."
    },
    {
