          "url": "https://github.com/OleksandrChekhovskyi/hax/blob/7db349773eb70fa10e798d5b6662d4ee640dced5/README.md#L42-L43"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_580402cfbceac83ef4658c1f91ede2c07555b25fc46989564422f4fd5a4e4d56"
      ],
      "text": "The product runs on Linux, macOS, FreeBSD, and OpenBSD; on Windows it is used under WSL, and the BSDs are build-from-source only."
    },
