        "slc_ebe2e0ce07f800daa8128fdc7cda0fda92fa17ec7362dc74a63d6ab3b521143e"
      ],
      "text": "In the REPL, slash commands such as `/provider`, `/model`, `/effort`, `/preset`, `/config`, and `/preset-save` select providers and settings; Ctrl-T opens a transcript view in $PAGER and Ctrl-O shows the conversation as displayed."
    },
