      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_442b6a0e8bce1858dc9b2c631e344129a8dd759c690a6fac8d7656a963b129dc"
      ],
      "text": "Building from source requires a C compiler, libcurl, jansson, meson, ninja, and pkg-config; fzf is additionally used for @file completion when available."
    },
