        "slc_cf9be8216996c4d258e271e175dbdfa762d19514a30126e3cded94dcf4248f72"
      ],
      "text": "The project deliberately omits MCP marketplaces, a plugin runtime, IDE panels, and per-command permission prompts, composing instead via subprocesses and documenting each omission in docs/philosophy.md."
    },
