        "slc_7a2024863e3ebb76065ecbb75c53c0150f52f41553daefff36551a740be297ae"
      ],
      "text": "Automatic compaction summarizes history near the context limit, triggered by a configurable percentage threshold (default 85), with the context limit overridable per model."
    },
