        "slc_9c7afb082be3ff0ce902fa9f400cf83ee70e6750e10da828a6369bf302ba3db2"
      ],
      "text": "Presets can act as roles with description, system-prompt additions, and a tint; only presets with a description are advertised to the model as subagent delegation targets."
    },
